            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LCT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Oven temp was a bit high . Had to watch closely . Marinated mine in a ziplock and added minced garlic !! (rather than sprinkling balsamic on at the end) I also drizzled more at the end !!!!!\n I love asparagus in general , but this really did not have the normal asparagus taste at all . So, if you have someone who is not crazy about it , they probably would go for it !!!! This will be a regular for me !!",
            "datePublished": "2017-11-27T18:38:55.243Z"
